#. Activity log summary when a channel category was created. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new category, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:45
msgid "{actor} created the category {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {channel} श्रेणी बनाई"

#. Activity log summary when a channel of a type this app version cannot name was created. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:35
msgid "{actor} created the channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {channel} चैनल बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a channel of a type this app version cannot name was created inside a category. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name. {category} is the category that holds it, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:40
msgid "{actor} created the channel {channel} in {category}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {category} में {channel} चैनल बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for a new invite link when its channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who created the invite, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {code} is the invite code, shown as boxed text.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts:10
msgid "{actor} created the invite {code}"
msgstr "{actor} ने इनवाइट {code} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for a new invite link. {actor} is the member who created the invite, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {code} is the invite code, shown as boxed text. {channel} is the channel the invite leads to, shown as a channel chip.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts:5
msgid "{actor} created the invite {code} for {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {channel} के लिए इनवाइट {code} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a link channel was created. A link channel is a channel list entry that opens a web address. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:25
msgid "{actor} created the link channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने लिंक चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a link channel was created inside a category. A link channel is a channel list entry that opens a web address. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name. {category} is the category that holds it, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:30
msgid "{actor} created the link channel {channel} in {category}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {category} में लिंक चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for a role that was created in the community. {actor} is the member who created it, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {role} is the new role, shown in bold with its name, or deleted-role when its name is unknown. The app adds the bold, so do not add ** or <b>. Use the same word for role as the rest of the app.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogRoleMessages.ts:5
msgid "{actor} created the role {role}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {role} रोल बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a text channel was created. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:5
msgid "{actor} created the text channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने टेक्स्ट चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a text channel was created inside a category. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name. {category} is the category that holds it, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:10
msgid "{actor} created the text channel {channel} in {category}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {category} में टेक्स्ट चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a voice channel was created. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:15
msgid "{actor} created the voice channel {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने वॉइस चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary when a voice channel was created inside a category. {actor} is the member who made the change, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {channel} is the new channel, shown as a channel chip with its name. {category} is the category that holds it, shown as a channel chip with its name.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogChannelMessages.ts:20
msgid "{actor} created the voice channel {channel} in {category}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {category} में वॉइस चैनल {channel} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for a new webhook when its channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who created the webhook, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {name} is the name of the webhook, shown in bold by the app. Do not add ** or <b> around it.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts:90
msgid "{actor} created the webhook {name}"
msgstr "{actor} ने वेबहुक {name} बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for a new webhook. {actor} is the member who created the webhook, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {name} is the name of the webhook, shown in bold by the app. Do not add ** or <b> around it. {channel} is the channel the webhook posts in, shown as a channel chip.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogInviteWebhookMessages.ts:85
msgid "{actor} created the webhook {name} in {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {channel} में {name} वेबहुक बनाया"

#. Activity log summary for several messages that were deleted together when the channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who deleted them, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {count} is an ICU plural with the number of deleted messages, and # shows that number.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogExpressionMessageMessages.ts:120
msgid "{actor} deleted {count, plural, one {# message} other {# messages}}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {count, plural, one {# मैसेज} other {# मैसेज}} हटा दिए"

#. Activity log summary for several messages that were deleted together. {actor} is the member who deleted them, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System. {count} is an ICU plural with the number of deleted messages, and # shows that number. {channel} is the channel the messages were in, shown as a channel name chip, or the deleted-channel label when the channel no longer exists.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogExpressionMessageMessages.ts:115
msgid "{actor} deleted {count, plural, one {# message} other {# messages}} in {channel}"
msgstr "{actor} ने {channel} में {count, plural, one {# मैसेज} other {# मैसेज}} हटा दिए"

#. Activity log summary for one message that was deleted when the channel was not recorded. {actor} is the member who deleted it, shown as a clickable user chip, or the word System.
#: src/features/guild/utils/guild_tabs/audit_log/AuditLogExpressionMessageMessages.ts:110
